# Model overrides consumed directly by scenescape/scripts/init.sh
# (regex-matched into docker/.env at `make init` time).
#
# This is intentionally minimal — it is NOT a general-purpose .env.example.
# For the full, human-facing list of POI environment variables (Redis, API,
# DLStreamer pipeline, benchmark tuning, proxy, etc.) see the single
# canonical file: ../.env.example
#
# POI uses OpenVINO retail models (not YOLO). Device precision/config is in
# configs/res/all-cpu.env (default), all-gpu-cpu.env, etc. — select via:
#   make init DEVICE=all-gpu-cpu.env
DETECT_MODEL=person-detection-retail-0013
REID_MODEL=person-reidentification-retail-0277
